utton><button type=\"button\" class=\"pax-append\" data-reply=\"reply2\" data-text=\" -&gt;  \">-></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pax-append\" data-reply=\"reply2\" data-text=\" OH^-_aq  \">OH^-_aq</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pax-append\" data-reply=\"reply2\" data-text=\" H2O  \">H2O</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pax-append\" data-reply=\"reply2\" data-text=\" Cu^2+  \">Cu^2+</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pax-append\" data-reply=\"reply2\" data-text=\" Ag  \">Ag</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pax-append\" data-reply=\"reply2\" data-text=\" Cu_(s)  \">Cu_(s)</button>\t<li>En déduire l'équation de la réaction globale de la pile: (<i>Les coefficients stoechiométriques doivent\têtre ajoutés avec votre clavier le cas échéant</i>)<br>\t <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply3\" data-size=\"30\"></span><br>\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"pax-append\" data-reply=\"reply3\" data-text=\" -&gt;  \">-></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pax-append\" data-reply=\"reply3\" data-text=\" Cu_(s)  \">Cu_(s)</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pax-append\" data-reply=\"reply3\" data-text=\" e^-  \">e^-</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pax-append\" data-reply=\"reply3\" data-text=\" Ag^+  \">Ag^+</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pax-append\" data-reply=\"reply3\" data-text=\" Ag_(s)  \">Ag_(s)</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pax-append\" data-reply=\"reply3\" data-text=\" +  \">+</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pax-append\" data-reply=\"reply3\" data-text=\" OH^-_aq  \">OH^-_aq</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pax-append\" data-reply=\"reply3\" data-text=\" Cu^2+  \">Cu^2+</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pax-append\" data-reply=\"reply3\" data-text=\" H^+_aq  \">H^+_aq</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pax-append\" data-reply=\"reply3\" data-text=\" H2O  \">H2O</button>\t</ol>\t\t",
